[[Image:DSC 7439-MR-VoileLatine.jpg|thumb|{{lang|ru|парус}}|upright=1.15]]

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|orv|парусъ}}, of {{uncertain|ru|nocap=1}} origin. Either to be connected to {{cog|liv|pūŗaz|t=sail}}, {{cog|lv|bura|t=sail}}, {{cog|lt|bùrė|t=sail}}, or borrowed from {{der|ru|grc|[[φᾶρος]], [[φάρος]]|t=large cloth, spread}}, for which latter compare {{m|ru|у́ксус|t=vinegar}} and {{m|ru|па́рдус|t=pard}}, known Greek borrowings.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|па́рус}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-парус.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|c|па́рус|(1)|adj=па́русный|pejcoll=парусня́,парусня́к,парусьё}}

# [[sail]]

